Applications running on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> will terminate 15 minutes after the last user of the application closes their browser. Your use-case doesn't sound like something that would work well on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>, as the platform is designed for interactive applications versus long running jobs.

You might look into a platform like https://www.dominodatalab.com/

