Hi,

I am new to shiny, shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>, and javascript so please excuse me. I have spent several days trying to determine if I can include custom made htmlwidgets for R or use javascript and javascript plugins in shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>. For example, is it possible to include a JQuery multiselect plugin (https://github.com/davidstutz/bootstrap-multiselect) in shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>. This type of functionality would be key to some dashboards I wish to work on.  I went through the tutorial  "How to build a JavaScript based widget" at http://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/js-lesson1/ but it is unclear to me that I can use this in shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>. Also, I am not sure how/if I can use javascript plugins. Anything to help me further in this journey will be much appreciated.

Thanks,
Scott

