Hi,

There isn't really any reason why a custom htmlwidget would not work on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>. If you put your custom widget (package) on GitHub, shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> will be able to use it.

Hope that helps,
-Andy

