I have a shiny app which works fine when running in my computer. I have saved the image files in a folder named www inside the Shiny app directory following the guide lines from https://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/lesson2/. I am now trying to host this app in a website and I am following the guidelines from http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/index.html. It works, the website link is given below https://washoffmodelling.shinyapps.io/washoff-app/. But as you can see the image is not displayed. I googled the problem and the closest solution I can found is this answer <https://github.com/rstudio/rmarkdown/issues/504>. But it is about ioslides, does not actually solve my problem. Can somebody help me to sort out this problem? Thanks in advance.

