Ashok,

Unfortunately, shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> does not support running scheduled jobs. Applications will automatically wake up when they are accessed, and go to sleep when they are no longer being used. However you may be interested in the reactiveTimer <https://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/reactiveTimer.html> function inside of shiny.

